From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 20:13:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 725/725] mproton: Regenerate generated files.

Proton's Wine deletes configure, config.h.in and the generated Vulkan and
syscall files from git and regenerates them at build time. athei's tree
(and mach9's build-wine.sh, which requires $WINE_SRC/configure) keeps them
in git, so regenerate them after the series instead of carrying Proton's
deletions:

  tools/make_requests, tools/make_specfiles, dlls/winevulkan/make_vulkan
  (vk.xml 1.4.363, the version 11.20 pins), autoconf -f, autoheader -f

configure is generated by GNU Autoconf 2.71 (Ubuntu 24.04); athei's was
2.73. Re-run wine/scripts/regenerate.sh from the mproton repo after
changing the series.
